        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John D. Rockefeller III, David Rockefeller, Fred Katayama\n- Organizations: Japan Society, U.S.-Japan Council, Chase Manhattan Corporation\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- David Rockefeller was born on June 12, 1915, and died on March 20, 2017.\n- David Rockefeller was an American banker who served as chairman and chief executive of Chase Manhattan Corporation.\n- John D. Rockefeller III had the siblings Abby, Nelson, Laurance, Winthrop, and David Rockefeller.\n- Japan Society suspended all activities during World War II.\n- After World War II, Japan Society expanded under the leadership of John D. Rockefeller III.\n- Fred Katayama serves on the board of directors of Japan Society and the U.S.-Japan Council.",
